i-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Legs\"><img alt=\"Terra Legs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Legs_43b41b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mercenary%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Mercenary Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mercenary_Sword_0a8719.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"War Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/War_Axe_34a50d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F10.70\">10.70</a><br/>December 10, 2014<br/>Winter Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Underground Glooth Factory</b> is a the modern <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Factory\">Glooth Factory</a> build under <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a> to replace the old and abandoned one. Although it is directly below the old <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Factory\">Glooth Factory</a> there is no connection between the two. You enter the Underground Glooth Factory via the <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a>, the building east of the stairs to <a href=\"#/wiki/Upper%20Rathleton\">Upper Rathleton</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33651,31942,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33651, 31942, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond%20Factory%20Raids\">Oramond Factory Raids</a> also take place here on the second floor, see its article for more details about each raid. <a href=\"#/wiki/Jaccus%20Maxxen%27s%20Dungeon\">Jaccus Maxxen's Dungeon</a> can be accessed on the third floor of the Underground Glooth Factory. \n</p><p>To use the Slime Slide leading into the Underground Glooth Factory, you must have at least the rank of Citizen in the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a> (300 votes cast).\n</p><p>The following quests take place in this area:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Several missions of the <a href=\"#/quest/oramond-quest\">Oramond Quest</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/quest/hero-of-rathleton-quest\">Hero of Rathleton Quest</a> (in <a href=\"#/wiki/Jaccus%20Maxxen%27s%20Dungeon\">Jaccus Maxxen's Dungeon</a>).</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Underground Glooth Factory NPCs (13 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dregor\">Dregor</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text